Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Trigun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.40,0:00:33.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.68,0:01:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really want out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.58,0:01:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's 500 yards to town. Thanks\Nfor the ride! It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.64,0:01:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You aren't gonna listen, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.30,0:01:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, teach his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.22,0:02:08.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Serious sandstorms are forming, up to\N4,000 yards around the Orleans area.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.14,0:02:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All transportation has been stopped,\Nwith no immediate signs of resuming.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.10,0:02:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose we're stuck here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.06,0:02:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.10,0:02:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we just think of it\Nas some kind of vacation, Meryl?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.34,0:02:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this were a vacation, I know that I'd\Nspend it someplace a lot quieter than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.76,0:02:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did it! Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.14,0:02:27.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.05,0:02:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did it, I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.97,0:02:30.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an all-club straight!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.90,0:02:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's wonderful, Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.88,0:02:34.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I really like this game!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.80,0:02:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't play like this. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.38,0:02:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But wait, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.92,0:02:39.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.83,0:02:42.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just starting to have some fun here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.32,0:02:44.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Showing myself would\Nbe more fun than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.82,0:02:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there, would you two like to play?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.06,0:02:51.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you playing All Made?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.78,0:02:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, actually, we don't know any\Nother games, but thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.18,0:02:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't be that way, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.68,0:02:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll play. Deal me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.36,0:03:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, all right then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.72,0:03:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get this show on the\Nroad before my luck changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.02,0:03:03.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.93,0:03:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.80,0:03:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,High stakes. Gain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.72,0:03:10.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bet is for your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.48,0:03:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are three things I\Ncan't tolerate in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.64,0:03:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People who put ice and alcohol,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.40,0:03:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the pattern on a silhouette scorpion, and\Nslime who don't appreciate tranquility.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.62,0:03:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A robbery in my jurisdiction?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.60,0:03:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not on my watch, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.92,0:03:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what's the situation here, Stan?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.90,0:03:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.30,0:03:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you inform the Earl what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.60,0:03:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.51,0:03:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, according to the\Ntestimony from the witnesses,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.16,0:03:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the group consists of four\Ncriminals and four hostages.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.42,0:03:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a chance to talk to the\Nfolks that escaped and they told
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.02,0:04:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me that one of the hostages is a\Nreal pretty girl who loves cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.28,0:04:01.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.19,0:04:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bostalk, what are these\Nlowlifes looking for? Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.12,0:04:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they want a hundred\Nthousand double dollars
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.44,0:04:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and in consecutive bills\Nand a getaway wagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.36,0:04:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did they go and commit this crime\Nknowing that she's my daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.80,0:04:14.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet they did.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.26,0:04:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think it's any big secret\Nthat you're the wealthiest man in town
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.92,0:04:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and only you could come up with a hundred\Nthousand double dollars that quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.32,0:04:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let them get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.02,0:04:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If word of this gets around, hooligans\Nwill come swarming from everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.10,0:04:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My daughter will become their\Nplaything and when they're finished,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.14,0:04:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they'll discard her in the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.50,0:04:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose you wouldn't know that\Nfrom personal experience, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.00,0:04:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grim Reaper, postdoc, shut up. Stan,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.20,0:04:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're supposed to be the sheriff in this
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.20,0:04:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,town and it's your job\Nto help my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.98,0:04:43.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.89,0:04:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care how many have to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.42,0:04:48.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to do what it takes\Nto get her back in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.84,0:04:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't order me around, postdoc.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.88,0:04:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is not the old days
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.52,0:05:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.14,0:05:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.64,0:05:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no idea. Hey! Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.20,0:05:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back here, dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.60,0:05:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a hostage situation!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.22,0:05:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.13,0:05:22.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.05,0:05:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's dancing around too\Nmuch to even notice!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.66,0:05:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't hear a damn thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.02,0:05:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That brainless moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.70,0:05:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gonna upset the criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.70,0:05:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dang fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.54,0:05:40.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's dodging the bullets. Dodging?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.06,0:05:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That freak doesn't even\Nrealize he's being shot at.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.64,0:05:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like he's going inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.82,0:05:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.98,0:05:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.18,0:05:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.40,0:05:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you suicidal?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.68,0:05:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or too stupid to know better?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.54,0:06:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help somebody, robbers!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.52,0:06:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help somebody!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.10,0:06:09.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.01,0:06:11.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy's just an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.82,0:06:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Takes more than just an idiot\Nto be screaming that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.22,0:06:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, somebody help!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.72,0:06:20.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess we got five hostages now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.20,0:06:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The plan has not changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.20,0:06:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All this means is that there's one more\Nlife on the line we've got to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.14,0:06:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.32,0:06:29.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got through just\Nabout two hours ago, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.10,0:06:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be ready by the deadline\Nthe criminals gave us, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.68,0:06:34.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Bostock,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.60,0:06:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it'd be a good idea for you to\Nkeep praying for your daughter's safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.48,0:06:42.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, and by the way, while\Nyou're at it, don't forget the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.18,0:06:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow! Be more gentle, brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.04,0:06:49.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't try anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.68,0:06:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honest, you can even take my gun, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.42,0:06:53.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.34,0:07:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here catch oh that's heavy custom made huh\Nyou're packing some serious firepower for
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.96,0:07:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,such a scrawny guy hey if you don't mind
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.92,0:07:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,could you give it back\Nto me when you're done?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.46,0:07:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shut up you little maggot\Nwell hello hello you know
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.12,0:07:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what i've been going\Nthrough a lot of hell since
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.06,0:07:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i met the two of you we\Nare the ones that are in
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.46,0:07:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hell you idiot oh that\Nreally hurt are you okay oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.64,0:07:24.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.96,0:07:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.46,0:07:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.10,0:07:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.46,0:07:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a creep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.38,0:07:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is not the way a\Nlady should be treated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.66,0:07:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am appalled by her lack of manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.84,0:07:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are ladies too, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.34,0:07:43.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, guess I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.96,0:07:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This lady's a special case.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.86,0:07:48.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She serves as a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.48,0:07:49.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.39,0:07:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must want my family's money.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.82,0:07:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That has to be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.20,0:07:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why else would they rob\Nthis two-bit saloon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.64,0:07:59.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you ever forgive\Nme, Miss Stephanie?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.64,0:08:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I failed to protect you. Dressing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.26,0:08:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you weren't thinking of\Ndemanding anything too extravagant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.04,0:08:07.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.95,0:08:12.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if it's pocket money you want, I'm sure\NI can easily get that from my daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.64,0:08:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pocket money.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.30,0:08:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.68,0:08:19.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.59,0:08:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.58,0:08:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knock it off, Jean!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.66,0:08:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stephanie!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.76,0:08:24.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.67,0:08:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll pull the trigger!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.62,0:08:26.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.53,0:08:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.45,0:08:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Screw you, Daniel!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.32,0:08:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.54,0:08:50.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to get a\Nhold of yourself, Jean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.28,0:08:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better keep your mouth shut, cause\Nnext time it just might be me with the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.78,0:09:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't we all just get along?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.66,0:09:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Peaceful-like?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.06,0:09:03.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.14,0:09:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I'm sorry! Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.36,0:09:13.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gum?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.40,0:09:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.54,0:09:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It couldn't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.46,0:09:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're using them?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.76,0:09:27.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.67,0:09:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're a lovely bunch of\Nmercenaries who would do anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.48,0:09:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even kill their very own families\Njust to get a little bit of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.00,0:09:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're actually quite\Nskillful and best of all,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.04,0:09:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they have no respect for each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.04,0:09:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are the perfect men for the child.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.78,0:09:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they'll take control of the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.24,0:09:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take my word, Willa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.78,0:09:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I trust they won't\Naccidentally shoot my daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.88,0:09:52.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that all depends on how\Nmuch money you offer them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.56,0:09:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think of it this way, unless\Nyou make it worth their while,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.66,0:09:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they won't be able to tell\Nher apart from a sandroach.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.14,0:09:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ain't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.84,0:10:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give them what they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.64,0:10:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they'd better not lay\Na finger on my daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.58,0:10:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, got yourself a tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.38,0:10:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's get this little\Nparty underway, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.52,0:10:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get it through your head, moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.22,0:10:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.00,0:10:36.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.26,0:10:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time is running out, you little weasels.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.38,0:10:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You all had better hope the\Nwagon and money gets here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.78,0:10:47.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I don't want to hear about any more\Ndelays or I'm gonna have to get angry
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.70,0:10:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough of that denim.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.28,0:10:50.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We still got work to do
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.08,0:10:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me if you receive\Nthe money you're asking for
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.08,0:10:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will you promise to release\Nmiss Stephanie unharmed?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.14,0:10:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all up to her father for her sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.78,0:11:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope he doesn't do anything stupid.\NKeep it down. The satellites on
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.16,0:11:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash the Stampede. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.42,0:11:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's what I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.90,0:11:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Humanoid Typhoon is in this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.48,0:11:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, if Big Man Bostalk or the Sheriff\Nhires Vash the Stampede, the party's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.08,0:11:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll all be dead before sunrise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.74,0:11:23.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't lose your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.36,0:11:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep it together now, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.72,0:11:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost time. Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.06,0:11:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's coming this way! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.70,0:11:31.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you to stay still!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.04,0:11:32.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.90,0:11:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's here, man. It's the wagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.28,0:11:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.72,0:11:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.14,0:12:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's your wagon and $10,000,000\Nin nonconsecutive bills.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.02,0:12:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have met your demands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.64,0:12:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Release your hostages immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.78,0:12:06.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not quite yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.12,0:12:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First we check the wagon and the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.86,0:12:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.22,0:12:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try anything, and the hostages\Nare dead meat! Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.84,0:12:16.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.08,0:12:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.54,0:12:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think your father will hand\Nover the money without trying anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.78,0:12:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My daddy will do anything to\Nprotect me, no matter what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.66,0:12:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stan's another matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.62,0:12:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.14,0:12:55.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Marvin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.28,0:12:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.70,0:12:58.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back here, Gene!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.94,0:13:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, Gene!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.04,0:13:35.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.02,0:13:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.44,0:13:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this how they work in this town?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.96,0:13:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is really stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.98,0:13:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'd say it's a bit overboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.42,0:13:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I was gonna say, he's\Nnot exactly a normal sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.64,0:13:45.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.56,0:13:46.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.82,0:13:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.20,0:13:52.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You probably could have slipped\Nout of the ropes at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.78,0:13:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But who in the head?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.72,0:13:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mr. Robberman!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.32,0:13:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you show us your pretty face?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.14,0:14:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we'd be happy to make it a lot\Nprettier with some hotline surgery!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.26,0:14:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.62,0:14:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.92,0:14:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, can we kill him, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.00,0:14:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can kill anyone but the girl! Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.06,0:14:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop, I beg you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.68,0:14:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, don't shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.92,0:14:33.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what, friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.62,0:14:36.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone ever tell you\Nthat you lack compassion?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.08,0:14:41.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.99,0:14:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just shoot the guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.72,0:14:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, tough guy, so I guess you\Nthink you have a hostage now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.82,0:14:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.90,0:14:51.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we'll all make\Nmore money on this deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.20,0:14:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rem...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.11,0:15:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy really is a stupid ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.80,0:15:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody, what in the\Nhell were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.90,0:15:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What made you decide you\Nweren't going to shoot him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.60,0:15:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really glad that you didn't shoot him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.66,0:15:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.18,0:15:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I don't like pain very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.86,0:15:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.26,0:15:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay now? Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.04,0:15:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understand the sheriff never had any\Nintention of giving you any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.98,0:15:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll Ask daddy to let you go free if you\Nwill promise to just stop all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.84,0:15:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not something I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.68,0:15:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I have reasons for\Nwhat I've done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.96,0:15:55.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do You know anything about the huge\Ngraveyard on the northeast outskirts of?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.64,0:15:56.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.55,0:16:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our parents are buried beneath that hellish\Nwasteland, where now even the corpse
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.80,0:16:02.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,weeds won't grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.71,0:16:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember them working like animals\Nin the fields, covered in dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.40,0:16:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally, after ten years, they managed\Nto make this sandy soil usable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.32,0:16:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was an amazing
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.12,0:16:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Accomplishment then, about 15 years ago,\Nyour father showed up and stole the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.82,0:16:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those good people sweated blood to plow.\NHe earned the name Grim Reaper Bostalk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.12,0:16:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he slaughtered them\Nall at this point line would
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.36,0:16:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,accomplish nothing we We\Ndon't care about the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.78,0:16:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever happens, I will not run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.32,0:16:48.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, I will take revenge\Nfor what happened 15 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.52,0:16:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mark my words.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.24,0:16:56.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's impossible to forget\Nsomething like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.58,0:17:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.08,0:17:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.66,0:17:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.10,0:17:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll get you some help, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.44,0:17:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I gonna die?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.46,0:17:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.58,0:17:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.56,0:17:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bullet passed right through.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.46,0:17:21.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.37,0:17:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will now discuss the demands\Non behalf of these men.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.28,0:17:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.32,0:17:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has my oldest daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.36,0:17:34.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.80,0:17:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But hear this, Stan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.00,0:17:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When all of this is over, I will\Nhold you personally responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.30,0:17:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was feared fifteen years\Nago as Grim Reaper Bostalk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.36,0:17:49.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing how the love of a daughter in\Nthe passage of time can change a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.34,0:18:06.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have what you want now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.14,0:18:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to release the girl, Ingwe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.12,0:18:11.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me for\Nwhat I'm about to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.80,0:18:17.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not an easy thing to escape\Nfrom a past you can't bury.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.60,0:18:21.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't look away anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.56,0:18:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time you face the\Ntruth about your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.16,0:18:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can no longer remain ignorant\Nof the hopes of the people
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.84,0:18:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because of the terrible lie\Nyour entire life was built upon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.00,0:18:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am aware of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.52,0:18:32.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am aware of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.12,0:18:38.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, even if it is true that he was\Nresponsible for all those horrible things,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.86,0:18:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he is still my daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.84,0:18:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how disobedient\Nor selfish I was growing up,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.86,0:18:47.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he was always a warm, dedicated\Nand loving father to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.74,0:19:24.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.78,0:19:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father, I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.56,0:19:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy, hold on! Daddy! Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.54,0:19:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Daddy, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.70,0:19:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm I'm all right, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.26,0:19:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only my shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.00,0:19:42.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you crying about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.36,0:19:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, I don't want you\Nthanking me for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.46,0:19:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just simply got distracted\Nand it threw my aim off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.70,0:19:51.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.74,0:19:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't believe he's really crying
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.74,0:19:57.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.78,0:19:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm turning myself in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.98,0:19:59.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.02,0:20:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too soon for the epilogue.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.92,0:20:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all over, Stan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.40,0:20:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna give myself up. Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.72,0:20:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still need you to resist me. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.86,0:20:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never dreamed that I would be\Npresented with such an opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.08,0:20:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see the headlines now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.54,0:20:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besieged criminal kills Mr. Bostalk.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.86,0:20:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sheriff forced to shoot culprit\Ndown as he attempts to resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.12,0:20:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It makes for a pretty article.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.90,0:20:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A real showpiece for my scrapbook.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.14,0:20:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Stan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.84,0:20:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sheriff is a position of honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.86,0:20:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.10,0:20:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fifteen years ago, this man\Nstole every right to this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.56,0:20:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have been just as powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.44,0:20:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yet I was stuck as the lowly sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.82,0:20:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'm way past due to receive\Na little glory around these parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.32,0:20:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were in on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.04,0:20:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a fiend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.38,0:20:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a scoundrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.76,0:20:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Throw down your weapons right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.22,0:20:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You unarmed stray dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.50,0:20:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How grand to be superior.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.54,0:21:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have one question.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.58,0:21:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, how does it feel to kill\Nunarmed innocent people like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.54,0:21:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I have a question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.38,0:21:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you feel anything when\Nyou burn your garbage?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.82,0:21:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nifty answer. Sorry I asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.66,0:21:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.28,0:21:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.82,0:21:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you figure out that I was armed?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.74,0:21:38.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't remember telling you about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.74,0:21:39.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.65,0:21:41.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You helped me in the saloon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.56,0:21:47.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can recognize the smell of\Ngunpowder and grease instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.64,0:21:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, now...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.96,0:21:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastards! I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.60,0:21:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you think, Sheriff?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.28,0:21:58.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How does it feel to be at the\Nmercy of a stray dog, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.76,0:22:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can relax, Sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.68,0:22:09.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.08,0:22:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.32,0:22:18.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No longer have the right to be Sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.94,0:22:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wanna know something interesting, Sheriff?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.42,0:22:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Repeat carefully after me, Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.44,0:23:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.54,0:23:46.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.45,0:23:48.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you, I'll see you,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.54,0:23:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.04,0:23:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.98,0:23:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,see
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.36,0:24:00.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.66,0:24:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is lost will never return.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.32,0:24:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Important things, irreplaceable things.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.52,0:24:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what is needed to keep those things is\Nin the firm will, packed into one bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.30,0:24:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man knows, he knows that nothing\Nwill begin unless he speaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.70,0:24:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that nothing will\Nchange unless he moves.

